	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010020a"},
		line=1332,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"At eight of the clock in the morning, I wait for Akari in front of the shop.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Morning, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Akari emerges from the building dressed in her school uniform.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Her figure is well-proportioned.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"A pleasantly ample chest and slender hips.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The legs peeking out from her skirt are dazzlingly white, reflecting the morning sun.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"She has a healthy beauty to her that could not be attained by merely being thin.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Her body also possesses the lean muscles cultivated by long practice with the blade.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, how do I look?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The moment she shows off her uniform, her skirt dances on the spring breeze.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Aaahh!”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“D-Did you see?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you mean your underwear, then yes, I did.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't be so calm about it!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“My apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“'My apologies,' he says...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You really don't get it, do you?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"Akari pinches the corners of her eyes, as if fighting back a headache.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All that aside, how are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you change the subject like that!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"She bares her teeth like an angry cat.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like I've got nothing to worry about.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“She probably shouldn't do anything strenuous, but she should be just fine going about her day.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"The manager suddenly emerges from inside the shop.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Manager! I'm terribly sorry I couldn't thank you properly yesterday.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Not only did you put yourself out Healing me, you're even letting me live here. I can't thank you enough.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Pay it no mind. I'm just glad to help however I can.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I managed to close your wounds with magicks, but try to not push yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“*Cough...* *cough, cough!*”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The manager doubles over feebly.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Manager?!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“My apologies, I think I had a bit too much to drink.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Drink?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It doesn't look like it, but he's perfectly healthy. Don't worry about him.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“At any rate, I wish you all the best on your fresh start.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"The manager looks at the two of us.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Good for you, Soujin-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari's the one starting a new life, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's true, but...”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Heh heh. Never mind. Forget I said anything.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then we'll be going now.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"After walking for some time, we arrive at the school.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Men and women in uniforms stream through the gates one after another.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Wow, there's a lot of Republicans.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Akari blinks in astonishment from beside me.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Seventy percent of our five hundred or so students are Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let me warn you right now. You should consider the entire campus as Republican territory.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll run into a lot of things that grate on your nerves, but please bear with it.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll try my best.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“When you say it so easily, it only sounds suspicious.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm expecting exemplary conduct befitting my lord.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you're testing me, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Akari shows me a defiant smile.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"This isn't a game, you know.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I told you this yesterday, too, but you left your blade at home, right?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No weapons allowed on campus, right?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even having it in your bag can get you accused of attempted homicide.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But while we're on the subject, they're allowed to carry guns without consequence.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“How ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's what it means to lose a war.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Akari glares at the building, displeasure evident on her face.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You might not be able to dodge their bullets if they catch you unawares. Don't let your guard down.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, most people can't dodge 'em at all...”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...At any rate, let's just try to get through today without incident.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"I nudge Akari past the school gates, her eyes shimmering with curiosity.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I give Akari a cursory tour of the school building.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"At first, she tensed up every time we passed a Republican, but she's starting to get used to it.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"Just as I make to enter our classroom, a crowd approaches us from across the hallway.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"The commotion is coming only from Republicans.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The one in the middle of that crowd is Senior Colonel Elsa Valentine. Heard of her?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She's the daughter of the Republic's governor-general and commander of the Tenkyo Central Division. She's in charge of maintaining public safety.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"She's also the person who pushed the Sworn Blades to the brink of collapse during the August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"To begin with, the Sworn Blades were formed immediately after the war as a mutual aid society for warriors to help each other out.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"On the surface, it worked to help us find new jobs and to support bereaved families, but secretly, it worked for the restoration of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"But on that fateful day, August 8th two years ago...",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Republican soldiers under Elsa's command stormed our headquarters, capturing and killing many of our senior members, including the chairman.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"As far as the public is concerned, the Sworn Blades were no more. Those of us who survived had no choice but to retreat underground.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"For her role in subjugating the warriors and her status as the governor-general's daughter, Elsa became a hero of the Republic overnight.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Good morning to you, Tokita-kun.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Morning.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"Her exquisite, perfectly-maintained hair dances in the morning sun.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"Her status and good looks are built on the corpses of my comrades.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I ought to cut her down here and now, but even if I did, someone else would simply take her place.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Nothing would be gained, and the enemy would only grow even more cautious of us.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I beg your pardon, but is this the first time we've met?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Today's my first day back at school. My name is Miyaguni Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm Elsa Valentine. The president of the student council here at Tenkyo Imperial Academy.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I hope your time here is an enjoyable one.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'll do everything in my power as president to support you.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The president extends her right hand to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm not used to Republican salutations. Perhaps next time?”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, is that so? What a shame.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The president retracts her hand.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“I'm sure it'll be the universal greeting in the near future, so it'd be best to start getting used to it.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll believe that when I see it.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The president eyes widen in wonder.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Hehehee. You're certainly a marsh one.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'Harsh,' you mean.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Pardon me. I'm not quite used to the Imperial tongue yet.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"The president smiles cheerfully and brushes her hair over her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Here at the academy, there is no need to think in terms of Empire and Republic. Let's all just get along as fellow students, yes?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And with that, I bid you good day.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Her hair fluttering behind her, the president takes her leave, her entourage in tow.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Akari wastes no time in leaning on the handrail overlooking the courtyard.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Talk about condescending.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's how most Republicans are. You can't let them get to you.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Akari looks at me, full of dissatisfaction.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think I like the way you're acting so calm.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There are times you have to turn the other cheek and bide your time.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You only get to say that when there's some greater purpose you're working towards.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Otherwise, you're just taking abuse lying down. Don't you ever forget that.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Akari stomps off in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Our classroom's the other way.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Her feet snap to a halt.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I take it back. I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"definitely",
{"/font"},
" don't like your attitude.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"First period ends, and we move to our second period classroom.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"In this school, barring a few required courses, students are free to create their own schedules.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"That's why, rather than the teachers coming to the classrooms, the students move to the rooms for the lessons they want to take.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"For her first day, I'm having Akari stick with me.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"I hear a melody I've heard several times before.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Its source is a Republican leaning against the handrail in the hallway.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Heya, Soujin. How are you?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"Rochel gives me a gentle smile.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"I forget when I first met him, but he's a strange fellow who speaks in a friendly manner, even to Imperials.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“I see you've finally found your soulmate.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“You're so strait-laced, I was getting worried.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You were worried? That's news to me.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And by the way, she's not my lover. Just a friend.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Today's her first day back at school. Her name's Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hello. It's a pleasure to make your acquaintance.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Nice to meet you. I'm Rochel, a Republican soldier.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Rochel bows in the style of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"He's better-versed in the Empire's culture than most Imperials, to the extent that many Republicans would call him an “Imperiophile.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“How are you finding school so far?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's quite stimulating. I haven't had many opportunities to talk with Republicans before.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“If possible, I hope you don't hate us for our nationality.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Both the Empire and the Republic have good people and bad people.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Which one are you?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“A bad person, of course. Roar, roar!”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"He plays around by imitating a lion.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehehee, you're a funny one.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Thank you. To hear your laughter is truly the highest of honors.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Rochel shows us a refined smile.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Anyway, Rochel, we need to get going.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Rochel"},
			{
"“Oh, sorry for holding you up.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Until next time, then.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"We arrive at our second period classroom.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"I sit in the very back of the room, as always.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Just like any other warrior, I feel much more at ease with a wall to my back.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How was that last lesson? Think you can keep up?”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Easily. Just how many private tutors do you think I had growing up?”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, if it isn't Soujin. Salutations.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"The girl who sits down next to me with a Republic-style greeting is Kurushima Shino.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Hotori sits down on her other side.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"Hotori and Shino go back a long way, and they can often be seen together.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're Miyaguni-san? Hotori told me all about you.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Name's Kurushima. Nice to meetcha.”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Uh, yeah, nice to meet you.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Um, Kurushima? As in...”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, probably the Kurushima you're thinking about.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Shino grins, snapping one of her eyes shut.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"Despite her youth, Shino serves as the head of the Kurushima Group, the Empire's leading financial conglomerate.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			{
"She's half-Republican, and apparently lived over there before the war.",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"As a result, she acts like a Republican and talks like a man.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Is it just me, or do you seem sorta high-class?”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, is it that obvious?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Better watch out, Hotori. Can't let your guard down around this one.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Mind your own business.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Without even turning this way, Hotori opens her textbook on her tablet computer.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Our next lesson is Modern History, a required class.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"In a sense, this class is our school's infamous specialty.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"It's rough to sit through, to put it mildly.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"The classroom is bristling with activity.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"The student council president has arrived.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Welp, time for our dear president's lesson.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll see.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"The class begins.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"In Modern History, what we learn is the history of the Republic, not the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The lectures are centered around asserting the legitimacy of the Republic's various conquests.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"The issue is that unlike conventional Imperial classes, Republican classes are conducted in the form of a dialogue.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“There are many countries in the world suffering under the oppression of dictators.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Albright Republic fights to save those countries from the clutches of their tyrants.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Empire is one such country we liberated from the tyranny of its Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"Called on by the teacher, the president gives her usual answer.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"It's the doctrine the Republic uses to justify waging wars all across the world.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Why does the Republic take it upon itself to bring about world peace?",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Nobody asked them in the first place.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(What the heck is this class?)”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(The class where we learn how righteous the Republic is.)”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(This is so stupid.)”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"She's beside herself with indignation.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Oh, it seems like you have some opinions over there.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"The president looks towards Akari.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Stand, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Play nice.)”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Yeah, yeah.)”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Akari stands up.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Her back straight, she fixes her gaze on the president.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I've seen it so many times now, but her bearing truly is beautiful.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"She's wearing the same uniform as everyone else, but for some reason, it feels entirely different when worn by her.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Miyaguni-san, was it? What do you think of the Republic's current policies?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's awfully self-righteous of them to dictate how other countries should exist.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Wow.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"The president's eyes widen for a moment.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Ugh... I knew this'd happen.)”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"Hotori and Shino both gape in astonishment.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The duty of a country is to protect the peace of its own people, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“And for countries to protect their own peace, there needs to be peace in the world.”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's the case, is there anything wrong with Imperials fighting the Republic to protect the lives of their countrymen?”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republic liberated the Empire from the hands of a dictator.”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"The president leans forward with her hands on her desk.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"She's not angry.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"Rather, she's beaming, like a warrior who's finally met with a worthy foe.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What sophistry.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Empire doesn't take kindly to invaders.”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			{
"She glares sharply at the president.",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"No student has ever picked a fight this directly before.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(She's pretty gutsy. I'll give her that.)”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Part of me doesn't want her to cause a scene, but another part of me feels invigorated.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“A question, if you please. Where does the legitimacy of the\nEmperor's rule emanate from?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Their covenant with Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Emperor rules over the land in Oomikami's stead.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"So it is written in the Imperial Chronicles, the source of our founding myth.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"Long, long ago, the lands of the Empire were formed from chaos by Oomikami.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"This land was created as a paradise on Earth, but as the ages went by, it devolved into a realm overrun by savages.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Left with no choice, Oomikami sent His own daughter, Himi-no-Mikoto, down to reign over the land.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Upon descending fro",
{"ruby", text="The Divine Plains"},
"m Takamagahara, ",
{"/ruby"},
"Himi-no-Mikoto quelled the savages with her magicks and her virtue, uniting the realm.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"Such was the origin of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"For over two thousand years since then, Himi-no-Mikoto's descendants have ruled over this land as its Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The divine right of kings, huh? That's an awfully outdated way of thinking.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Inventing a mythos and instilling it on the populace to legitimate their authority is the oldest trick in the despot's book.”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“In a manner of speaking, couldn't you call this brainwashing?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“The Republic liberates people from such irrational forms of governance.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"The president speaks with a steadfast calmness.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"By contrast, Akari appears to be greatly enjoying the debate.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If you're gonna bring up brainwashing, I could say the same to you.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The only reason this class exists is because you're so desperate to convince yourselves you're right, am I wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Trying to avoid facing your conscience?”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"Suddenly, three Republican boys stand up.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"With their imposing stature, characteristic of Republicans, they make the room feel smaller just by standing.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"I feel embarrassed watching them make an outward display of cracking their knuckles.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"They need some education.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"In the same instant, Hotori glances at me.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"She mouths at me, “You aren't any different.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Looks like she saw right through me.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"But that doesn't mean I can forsake Akari.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"I quietly stand up.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Whaaaaat!?)”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"She raises a voiceless scream.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"And so, she stands up as well, albeit with incredible reluctance.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What's the matter with you two?”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just felt like stretching my legs.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Same.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If you have nothing to say, then please take your seat.”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd like to see those guys over there sit down first.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"They, of course, do not.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"On the contrary, another five, then ten Republicans stand up.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"The air of the classroom is as tense as a fully drawn bow.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"With just the slightest trigger, the arrow will be let loose.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Out of nowhere, a happy-go-lucky tune starts playing.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm? It's my phone.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whoops, don't know how to stop it.”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sorry, don't mind me. I'll turn it off as soon as I figure out how.”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"Shino casually waves her hand as she fiddles with her phone.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"The tense atmosphere is shattered at once.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Kurushima-san, don't you think it's only proper manners to turn your phone off before class?”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, sorry 'bout that. I just got a new one, and I don't know how to use it yet.”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"The president lets out a heavy sigh.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"She's realized that Shino played the music on purpose.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is supposed to be a debate.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would defeat the purpose to discourage a frank exchange of opinions.”",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Tokita-kun is right.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“If anything, I believe Miyaguni-san is deserving of high praise indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“What does everyone else think?”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"The president manufactures a pleasant smile.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			{
"Even the well-built goons over there accept her words and sit down.",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			{
"If the other side is taking their seats, I have no further reason to remain standing.",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"The only ones left standing are Akari and the president.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Thank you for your valuable perspective.”",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“No, no, thank you for indulging me.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"Akari sits down.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(That was quite the scene.)”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(This class is a complete joke.)”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"Not even a little bit of remorse, huh?",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Thanks for standing up for me earlier.)”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Hmm? Oh, yeah.)”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(You too, Inou.)”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"Hotori doesn't spare her a response.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Ooh, she's mad... But that figures.)”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(If you knew that, then why did you go at the president in the first place?)”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Compared to assassinating the chancellor, this is hardly worth mentioning, is it?)”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Some lord you are...)”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Crap, I lost some points.)”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"Akari grimaces.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"I swear, what a foolhardy lord she is.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Who knows when she'll cause even more serious problems?",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"Yet despite my exasperation, I can't stop the smile from creeping across my face.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
